<title>NIGERIA: Third qtr profits down at Nigerian CMB.</title>
<headline>Third qtr profits down at Nigerian CMB.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third-quarter result for packaging company Carnaud Metal Box (CMB) to end-September 1996. (In million naira)</p>
<p>					   1996	 1995</p>
<p> Turnover			     1,000	 771.8</p>
<p>Profit before exceptional item     49.8	 8.7</p>
<p> Exceptional item			14.6     131.8</p>
<p> Profit before taxation		64.5     140.5</p>
<p> Taxation				   --	 42.2</p>
<p> Tax credit				22.3	 --</p>
<p> Profit after taxation		 86.8	98.3</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
